      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Features & Services:</li><li> Spacious, light-filled, well-appointed 5-bedroom semi-detached house.</li><li> Versatile accommodation extending to 180sqm/1,938sq.ft. with an interconnecting 1-bedroom annex.</li><li> Excellent central location in the heart of Bray on a highly desirable residential street.</li><li> Generously proportioned, private landscaped rear garden with an array of mature planting and two patio areas. </li><li> Abundance of local services and amenities to choose from including schools, shops, cafes, restaurants & bars, sports & recreational facilities, churches, and more.</li><li> Excellent choice of transport links with regular DART and Dublin Bus services, the Luas is nearby in Cherrywood and Carrickmines, the N11/M11/M50 all offering easy access into Dublin.</li><li> Private off-street parking.</li><li> BER D1</li><li> Gas fired central heating (GFCH).</li><li> Mains water & sewerage.</li><li> Usual TV, phone and broadband services.</ul>"
